as-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-cta--fullbleed has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Modern comfort in Hazleton&#039;s historic homes<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hazleton&#039;s coal-era housing wasn&#039;t designed for central HVAC, but that doesn&#039;t mean you can&#039;t have modern comfort. Whether you&#039;re upgrading an old boiler, adding air conditioning, or rethinking your entire heating strategy, the right approach respects the home&#039;s constraints while delivering the performance you need. These homes have survived a century\u2014they deserve systems that work for the next one.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Book the Rowhouse Assessment<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--2\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:+1\">Call Now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"s-credits has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Photos: &quot;1501-1509 R Street NW&quot; by NCinDC, BY-ND, via Openverse \u00b7 AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image) \u00b7 &quot;Cast Iron Radiator Refurbishment&quot; by gavindjharper, BY-ND, via Openverse<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Hazleton PA HVAC for anthracite-region immigrant housing. Boilers, radiators, mini-splits, and ductwork for coal-era rowhouses and twins.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":0,"featured_media":197,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"cl